<%# S3c T1: earlier conversations, served INTO the panel frame (plan §7.6).

    Same frame element as show.html.erb, and deliberately WITHOUT the chat
    container: the list replaces the transcript rather than joining it. Rendering
    both would put two chatposts containers in the panel, and a broadcast would
    land in whichever Turbo found first. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag 'assistant_panel_body', class: 'flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col' do %>
  <%= render Neo::Chat::HistoryListComponent.new(
    threads: @threads,
    current_chat: @current_chat,
    current_organisation: current_organisation
  ) %>
<% end %>
